hat’s not evasion. That’s calculation. He’s weighing what he’s seen on camera against what he owes the school, the kids, and maybe even me.  \n\nI didn’t ask for proof. Didn’t demand answers. Just opened the door—and left the light on.  \n\nThat’s enough—for now.'}]
